	(text "The pack connects through J1401 (PACK_RAW), F1401 and Q1401 to VBAT_PACK. Q1402 is the charger's ship FET.\nU1401 senses VC2 at J1401.1 through R1404 (Kelvin) and VC1 at BATT_MID through R1405, and balances the cells.\nU1402 feeds the STM32 VBAT/RTC domain ahead of the ship FET. R1402 (0R) is not fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.446 197.358 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7ce0a8a4-1c64-42e4-8393-b85feea7cf90")
	)
	(text "ALWAYS-ON RTC SUPPLY: U1402 TPS70933 -> VBAT_RTC"
