		(property "Function" "BQ29209 RCB2 160R, top-cell Kelvin sense and balance resistor from PACK_RAW (J1401.1, before F1401/Q1401) to VC2 (SLUSA52C Fig. 9; ICB2 about 10 mA). Its PACK_RAW sense track runs alone to the J1401.1 pad (P1-5); the 160R limits a fault in this unfused branch to tens of mA."
