		(property "Function" "2S secondary overvoltage protection (4.30 V/cell) with automatic cell balancing. VC2 is Kelvin-sensed at J1401.1 (PACK_RAW, before F1401/Q1401) through R1404 per SLUSA52C Fig. 9, VC1 at BATT_MID through R1405, VDD from VBAT_PACK through R1407. OUT (BAL_OVP) drives U1101 CE through R1110 and TP1403."
