		(property "Function" "I1 reverse-polarity protection: P-MOSFET, drain on PACK_FUSED (after F1401), source on VBAT_PACK, gate to GND via R1403. A correctly connected pack turns it on (Vgs = -VBAT, 8.4 V max vs +/-12 V rating); a reversed harness leaves the body diode reverse-biased and the FET off. Place between F1401 and the VBAT_PACK node, in the J1401 notch."
